1. Chay lenh generate_erpnext_keys.py de tao ra API TOKEN va SECRET KEY
2. DEV thi chay docker-compose.yml cho backend
3. Co 3 thong tin sau:
    "gencode": "ts-node scripts/generate-crud.ts" => tao code
    "seed": "ts-node prisma/seed.ts" => seed data
    "sync-erpnext": "ts-node scripts/sync-to-erpnext.ts" => sync data sang erpnext chi cho test
    "worker": "ts-node src/worker.ts" => chay worker email, notification, heavy job, webhook, erpnext sync

4. Cai dat nhieu app cung luc
    ./install_custom.sh
    docker compose -f pwd-custom.yml up -d
docker compose -f pwd-custom.yml logs -f create-site

5. Chay bench clear-cache neu ko thay app xuat hien